  "sections": [
    {
      "body": "Humanlike movement starts at profile 1.0 before sandwalking. Animals use body-size bands: below 0.35 body size the profile is 0.0 (Muad'Dib is 0.20). A movement pulse of 0.022 is scanned every 60 ticks and vibration decays 0.00025 per tick.",
      "id": "signal",
      "title": "Movement signal"
    },
    {
      "body": "Stages are Quiet, then Minor at 0.15, Detected at 0.35, Strong at 0.55, Imminent at 0.8.",
      "id": "wormsign",
      "title": "Wormsign stages"
    },
    {
      "body": "Once committed, approach lasts 2100–2700 ticks. Cooldown after a strike is 9000 ticks. Live mouth VFX and churn/scar leftover terrain are implementation Things, not player-built furniture.",
      "id": "approach",
      "title": "Approach, breach, aftermath"
    },
    {
      "body": "Deep erg ambient maker intervals are 20000–40000 ticks; rocky country 40000–80000 ticks. Presence is not the same as a strike.",
      "id": "presence",
      "title": "Ambient presence"
    }
  ],
